00:50:24,000 --> 00:50:30,000
Murder, She Baked is an American/Canadian television film series based
on the cozy mystery novels written by Joanne Fluke.

10
00:56:00,000 --> 00:56:06,000
The television films are centered around small-town baker Hannah Swensen, portrayed by
Alison Sweeney, and Detective Mike Kingston, played by Cameron Mathison.

11
01:01:36,000 --> 01:01:42,000
Five films for the Hallmark Movies & Mysteries channel were created based on
Fluke's book series, with the fifth movie airing on March 26, 2017.

12
01:07:12,000 --> 01:07:18,000
The films took a four-year hiatus before returning
as the Hannah Swensen Mysteries.

13
01:12:48,000 --> 01:12:54,000
The films are set in the fictional town of Eden Lake in Minnesota,
reverting to Lake Eden like in the novels in the sixth film.

14
01:18:24,000 --> 01:18:30,000
The tone is mind_bending.
